    {
      "Original": "Imported markers arrive with only a single confirmation, so they stay hidden until other players confirm them or you lower your integrity threshold. Tick this to show them straight away, as though you had found them yourself.\n\nImported markers are never uploaded to a Palantir server either way.",
      "Context": "[Palantir] ConfigWindow.DrawData",
      "Role": "UI",
      "RoleReason": "→ ImGuiComponents.HelpMarker",
      "Translated": "导入的标记初始只有一次确认，通常需等待其他玩家确认，或调低可信度阈值后才会显示。勾选后可直接显示，就像你亲自发现的一样。\n\n不论是否勾选，导入的标记均不会上传至 Palantir 服务器。",
      "Source": "library"
    },
